## Known issues / blocked

1. PUSH BLOCKED (highest priority): every commit of this run is LOCAL ONLY. The
   remote rejects the branch because a commit touches .github/workflows/ci.yml and
   the stored OAuth credential lacks the `workflow` scope. Fix from your machine:
   `gh auth refresh -s workflow` (or push once with a PAT that has it), then
   `git push --set-upstream origin feat/clarion-phase-3-and-ui`.
2. Step 2 rail: @cloudflare/vitest-pool-workers cannot run green on Windows
